  "pages.faq.hero.overline": "Help centre",
  "pages.faq.hero.subtitle": "Quick answers to common questions. Still unsure? Contact our friendly team.",
  "pages.faq.hero.title": "Frequently asked questions",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_1.answer": "Visit our Timetable & Booking page and use the booking widget to select a class. You will be directed to our external booking partner to complete registration and payment.",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_1.question": "How do I book a class?",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_2.answer": "Yes — you can book a trial class from our Timetable page. Please note that trial classes are not free. If you're unsure which class suits you, contact us and we'll help you choose.",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_2.question": "Can I try a class before committing?",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_4.answer": "Courses run for a fixed term with a structured syllabus and limited places. Regular classes can often be booked on a rolling basis via the timetable.",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_4.question": "How are courses different from regular classes?",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_6.answer": "Events are booked directly via the Book Now button on each event page. Payments are processed securely through Stripe.",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_6.question": "How do I book an event or masterclass?",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_7.answer": "We're a five-minute walk from both Waterloo and Westminster stations.",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_7.question": "How do I get there?",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_hire.answer": "Yes — our 70 m² vinyl-floor venue and 200 m² wooden-floor hall can be hired separately or together, from £200 per hour (member rates available). See Venue Hire for details.",
  "pages.faq.items.faq_hire.question": "Can I hire the venue?",
